    "title": "East King Road to close near Belknap Covered Bridge for maintenance work - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News Staff ,\n12 hours ago LANE COUNTY, Ore. — A portion of East King Road near the Belknap Covered Bridge will be closed for several weeks beginning June 22, according to Lane County officials. Officials said the closure is necessary to allow crews to install scaffolding and complete painting work on the historic bridge. Read full article\n1",
